## ITEM 4 IN DETAIL (ONE READY, HOLD, merge, post, verify)
- **ONE READY:** `READY FOR QA (Seat C 1st): #<1> (KS-1382) + #<2> (KS-1355) …`, per STANDING_LINES `:17-:47`. It contains:
  - both PR numbers and HEADs read from origin in the same action;
